{"pin":"BH01572","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01572","anchor":"","first_line":"Hearken unto the divine Call, and with penetrating vision and illumined heart, ponder the wondrous words He hath revealed, and meditate thereon [3.5s]... ...Praise be to Thee, O my God!  I beseech Thee by Thy Most Great Name, whereby the Sun of Thy Command shone forth above the horizon of Thine inspiration","first_line_orig":"بشنوید ندای الهی را و ببصر حدید و قلب منیر در کلمات بدیعش نظر نمائید و تفکر  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"550","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#486\"\u003eLL#486\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or03116.078","source":"BLIB_Or03116","locator":"078"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or11096.172","source":"BLIB_Or11096","locator":"172"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15722.019","source":"BLIB_Or15722","locator":"019"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA33:018bx","source":"INBA33","locator":"018bx","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v033/?page=20"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA47:244","source":"INBA47","locator":"244","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v047/?page=246"},{"kind":"music","code":"almunajat.com [item 28]","source":"almunajat","locator":"com [item 28]","url":"https://almunajat.com/chanting_collection_2.htm"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADH1.012x","source":"ADH1","locator":"012x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/pdf/i/ishraq-khavari_adhkar_muqarrabin_1.pdf"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.210","source":"AHM","locator":"210","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-210.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_105BE #04 p.001x","source":"AKHA_105BE #04 p.001x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ2.099x","source":"AQMJ2","locator":"099x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ2/mmq2-100.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.453.07x","source":